      ans_qA1:'Classes start at 08:00. Each lesson lasts 45 minutes. Core (mandatory) subjects run roughly until 14:45 (through period 7). Between 15:00 and 17:45, some days include extra group sessions (English, digital literacy, etc.) and a homework-completion / extended-day period. The pre-school and kindergarten-prep groups (R5, R6, K5) follow a separate schedule: starting at 08:00 with 25-minute lessons, plus walks and rest breaks during the day. <b>The exact schedule for a specific class</b> is shared by the homeroom teacher.',
      ans_qA2:'Starting August 17, the school begins its "drop period" — a special two-week transition ahead of the new school year. Students gradually return to a learning rhythm after summer break, meeting teachers and new classmates. No new material is taught during this time.<br><br><b>Class hours:</b> 10:00 AM – 1:00 PM.<br><b>Where to bring your child:</b> to the school\'s main entrance.<br><b>Pick-up:</b> at 1:00 PM.<br><b>Uniform:</b> not required.<br><b>Meals:</b> not provided — please send food with your child.<br><b>What to bring:</b> 2–3 notebooks, pens, and colored pencils.<br><b>Attendance:</b> optional, at parents\' discretion.<br><b>Transport:</b> the school shuttle does not run during this period.<br><b>Registration:</b> sign up via the <a href="https://forms.gle/gGceDNye9ALa1d6B9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline text-emerald-900 font-bold">Google Form</a>.',
      ans_qA3:'The school uniform is not required during the drop period — children may come in comfortable, casual clothes.',
      ans_qA4:'Textbooks are fully provided by the school. They are handed out to students before the school year starts, from <b>September 1</b>.',
      ans_qA5:'If your child needs school transportation, you can contact the managers of <b>School Way</b> directly — the company our school partners with: <a href="tel:+77005191008" class="underline text-emerald-900 font-bold">+7 700 519 10 08</a>, <a href="tel:+77010410750" class="underline text-emerald-900 font-bold">+7 701 041 07 50</a>.<br><br>The managers will advise you on:<ul class="supply-list" style="columns:1; margin-top:.5rem;"><li>available routes</li><li>rates and pricing</li><li>adding your address to a route</li><li>organizing school transport</li></ul>For further details, please contact the numbers above.<img src="img/bus.jpg" alt="School Way" class="mt-3 rounded-xl w-full max-w-[280px]">',
      ans_qA6:'Students can join choreography, chess, boxing, ballet and other clubs. Contact the school administration for the current list and schedule.',
      ans_qB1:'The school uniform must be official Baiterek-branded wear, available at the shop on the school\'s 1st floor. Shop hours: 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM. It is included in the enrollment fee paid upon admission to the school. Each student receives 2 polo shirts and a bomber jacket. PE kit requires an official Baiterek-branded T-shirt, also sold at the same shop — but it is not included in the enrollment fee and must be purchased separately. All students are required to take good care of their uniform.',
      ans_qB2:'<span class="supply-scope">For grades 1–4 students</span><ul class="supply-list"><li>Watercolor paints (12 colors) — 1 set</li><li>Gouache</li><li>Palette — 1</li><li>Spill-proof water cup — 1</li><li>Brush set (pony, squirrel)</li><li>Wet and dry wipes</li><li>Desk cover, apron, sleeve covers</li><li>Drawing album</li></ul><p class="supply-note">Label all art supplies with the child\'s name and keep them in a folder.</p>',
      ans_qB3:'<span class="supply-scope">For grades 1–4 students</span><ul class="supply-list"><li>Labor/craft folder — 1</li><li>Colored paper</li><li>Colored cardboard</li><li>White cardboard</li><li>PVA glue tube — 1</li><li>Glue stick — 1</li><li>Modeling clay</li><li>Modeling board</li><li>Scissors</li><li>Natural materials (by mid-September)</li></ul><p class="supply-note">Label all labor-class supplies with the child\'s name and keep them in a folder.</p>',
      ans_qB4:'<span class="supply-scope">For grades 1–4 students</span><ul class="supply-list"><li>Diary/planner — 1</li><li>Notebook folder — 1</li><li>Small-grid notebooks — 10</li><li>Slanted-line notebooks — 10</li><li>Wide-line notebooks — 10</li><li>Notebook covers — 30</li><li>Book covers — 10</li><li>Book stand — 1</li><li>Pencil case</li><li>Compass</li><li>Blue ballpoint pens</li><li>Plain pencils — 3</li><li>Colored pencils (12 colors)</li><li>Soft eraser — 2</li><li>Wooden ruler, 20 cm — 1</li><li>Pencil sharpener</li><li>Textbook bookmarks</li><li>A4 paper — 1 pack</li></ul>',
